      <title>WhisperBar 1.20.1</title>
      <link>https://github.com/kchromik/shoutflow-releases/releases/tag/v1.20.1</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 10:47:07 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>69</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.20.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Fixed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Fixed a startup crash on older macOS versions after updating to WhisperBar 1.20.0.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
